	"font": {
		"$comment": "Every stack carries its Arabic companion behind the Latin faces — Amiri for the serifs, Tajawal for the sans. Browsers resolve a stack per glyph, so Arabic copy finds them while Latin keeps Playfair or Inter. Mobile sees only the first family and picks the Arabic face from `fontsByLanguage` instead.",
